{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Reclaim Your Corrupted Memories</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a captivating world where fragmented memories await discovery! In this side-scroller adventure, navigate the remains of a once thriving civilization and piece together your scattered past.\u00a0Between classical jump-n-run and puzzle solving, you have to keep a close eye on your surroundings. Explore the depths as you uncover forgotten stories and concealed corruption. On your journey, you must face the truth about your past life while reclaiming the essence of yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900900/extras/c09670ba7ec078dda8ad3f9b3c0371fe.poster.avif?t=1757016370\" width=700 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900900/extras/c09670ba7ec078dda8ad3f9b3c0371fe.webm?t=1757016370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>You Are Not Alone</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your way through this hostile world and challenge yourself with uncovering it's secrets. Along the way you'll meet enigmatic strangers - use their powers to navigate the environment on different ways. Learn how to walk through solid steel bars or see in the dark. Can they aid you on your journey? Remember, every light casts a shadow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900900/extras/35b7aef9c69ede2ed72d96e376d7ccc4.poster.avif?t=1757016370\" width=700 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900900/extras/35b7aef9c69ede2ed72d96e376d7ccc4.webm?t=1757016370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Evade The Lotus</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Danger lurks around every corner. Stay on high alert and avoid merciless enemies that threaten your progress. Use stealth and strategy to get past various types of opponents, ensuring that you can  reclaim your memories without falling victim to the nightmares that pursue you.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900900/extras/7b9cc61980f3a61b047a0fabb8839c3a.poster.avif?t=1757016370\" width=700 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900900/extras/7b9cc61980f3a61b047a0fabb8839c3a.webm?t=1757016370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Mesmerizing Music</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in this dystopian adventure with a live-recorded orchestral soundtrack that brings every moment to life. Feel the intensity and emotion as the music adapts to your journey, making each scene unforgettable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Key Features</i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-Driven Gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump-n-Run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special Abilities like Teleportation or Doublejump to overcome obstacles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Variety of different Puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with the World to make your way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Stealth and the Environment to evade different Enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the\u00a0live-recorded Orchestral Soundtrack adapting to your Gameplay</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","bac